      "description" : "Molbio Diagnostics is an innovative point- of-care (POC) diagnostics company that develops affordable, rapid, and accurate diagnostic solutions for infectious and non-communicable diseases. Its flagship product, Truenat, is a portable, battery-powered PCR testing platform that delivers results within an hour. Designed for use in resource-limited settings, it enables quick and decentralised disease diagnosis at the point of care. Through its wholly owned subsidiary, Bigtec Labs, Molbio has strong research and development capabilities focused on creating diagnostic platforms for point-of- care (POC) testing. From product development to large-scale deployment, the company aims to improve access to reliable and affordable healthcare for everyone. https://www.molbiodiagnostics.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Molbio-Diagnostics-Limited-Red-Herring-Prospectus.pdf#page=215 #}"
